/name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AISIN SEIKI KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AOKI, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUTA, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAKIHARA, MASAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TERADA, HARUHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYOTA JIDOSHA KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AOKI YASUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FURUTA YASUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAKIHARA MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TERADA HARUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AOKI, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUTA, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAKIHARA, MASAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TERADA, HARUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Cars in a charging zone (Z) are charged and cars outside the zone are not charged. The charging zone (Z) includes a buffer area (52) having a width r corresponding to the position recognition error of a GPS and a core area (50). When a car is outside the charging zone, a recognized position presence probability circle (54) determined by the recognized position found by the GPS may overlap with the buffer area (52), but not overlap with the core area (50). Therefore, even if a car is judged to be in the buffer area (52), the car may be absent in the charging zone, and the recognition that the car is present in the charging zone is negated.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Les voitures se trouvant dans une zone (Z) de taxation sont soumises à la taxation tandis que les voitures à l'extérieur de cette zone ne sont pas soumises à cette taxation. La zone (Z) de taxation comprend une zone (52) tampon dont la largeur (r) correspond à la marge d'erreur d'un système GPS de reconnaissance de position, et une zone (50) centrale. Lorsqu'une voiture se trouve à l'extérieur de la zone de taxation, un cercle (54) de probabilité de présence déterminé par la position reconnue trouvée par le système GPS peut chevaucher la zone (52) tampon, mais pas la zone (50) centrale. En conséquence, même si l'on estime qu'une voiture se trouve dans la zone (52) tampon, la voiture peut se trouver hors de la zone de taxation, ce qui permet au dispositif de refuser de reconnaître la présence de la voiture dans la zone de taxation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>